{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30002_01_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:501c06e0562cb25a4ec3ea8949a28be610e2dc319ec950700948d258f2fa26e3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:205b537162a622d6c13223069f400d4e8d55bf55b3cd45c60b78e4ab8e51e99c",
      "text": "拍摄当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e141bfca6cc104d2902f1551c2b8c9f3207943d3ba3bef356dad73b3bf823b4",
      "text": "各位，早上好！\n从今天开始的拍摄，大家一起加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e536d62b5dd18aee128c4a7511b99628f14336b658d5a8febc39c0be4ed61457",
      "text": "那是自然。比起那个，制作人，\n听说你从搭建器材阶段就来帮忙了。非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25618c9dfe750d349c3dd8391af7bbdd9cedde07a7c374e11460e91c369067c6",
      "text": "我还听说制作人将担任摄影师掌镜。\n添麻烦了，拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40e19223b4318e50cd1083484db9b6e8cce34fa164ce7035e2134c459185777c",
      "text": "没有的事，请不用介意我。\n比起那个，各位准备充分了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21b58270b4f91144b1d940db230d4ae4392f489adf59f19e25bd66d42ea4e412",
      "text": "Of course！直到今天我都反复读了好多次script，\n台词全都记熟了哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d263dd6c723d82e1c86249872ab3eb2d1c25a6b13a01ad20c0ea0499f3db846d",
      "text": "从主人公的涂鸦中诞生的fairy，\n教师型robot硲与山下＆舞田！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5901f023cf01f5149952c97375525aeeb054b3648a28051b8c527d0a9a67171f",
      "text": "三位fairy引导主角成为star……\n超级exciting的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fcc4fcd7b599994e8a30d77d42b8da4f03b72bf57f5091b8e2b0136bca32d5b",
      "text": "嘿，除了漫画什么都看不下去的类，\n居然读进剧本了啊。挺厉害的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bed012b0088a50388913f8b5878e81505d000623c359e56eb55527f75ebcbb7",
      "text": "啊哈哈，感觉看了一辈子份的word呢。\n不过，努力的可不只是我一个人吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1aaaa112a355e5bcdf1f2a3039149f66d132c7f3e46478efd0c2ad644ab436d5",
      "text": "Mr. 硲也在training\nrobot般的动作对吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7aaaea9de531256b0321829c0deceb96584d069557718f3f03af20f02db2890",
      "text": "嗯。虽然相当吃力，\n但我想总算是有模有样了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d20162312af2856058969c2770be25536b1c45f67a7bffccbc602fe925a8bdbd",
      "text": "山下君不也热心地陪着负责担任\n主角的他进行了很多练习吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3bdc9e3f3798f6a144db1d1b8a28f5f44a46828c531419a291aac58fc481d8b",
      "text": "虽然我没能给出什么了不起的建议就是了……\n这也是为了可爱的学生嘛，开玩笑的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34e874a1b902f1171af00e6dc286e8f9c5ffded2d7badbb99ce226e1631b799a",
      "text": "很好……各自都准备充分了。来吧，拼尽全力吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
